stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Draft: create<br/>(journal-entries.create)

    Draft --> Draft: edit lines<br/>(journal-entries.update)
    Draft --> Posted: post<br/>(journal-entries.post)<br/>below approval threshold
    Draft --> Pending: submit<br/>(maker)
    Pending --> Posted: approve<br/>(checker ≠ maker)
    Pending --> Rejected: reject + reason<br/>(checker)
    Rejected --> Draft: edit
    Draft --> Void: void<br/>(journal-entries.void)

    state "Pending approval" as Pending
    state "Rejected" as Rejected

    Posted --> Reversed: reverse<br/>(journal-entries.reverse)

    state Reversed {
        direction LR
        Original: Original entry<br/>stays "posted"<br/>reversed_by_entry_id set
        Mirror: Reversal entry<br/>debits ⇄ credits<br/>status "posted"
        Original --> Mirror: nets to zero
    }

    Void --> [*]
    Reversed --> [*]

    note right of Posted
        Gets its voucher number (JV-2026-00012):
        gapless per voucher type, in posting order.
        Immutable in the database: amounts, accounts,
        dates, status and voucher number never change.
        Correct by reversing.
    end note

    note right of Draft
        Not in balances or reports. Has a voucher
        type (JV, CPV, CRV, BPV, BRV…) but no number
        yet, so voided drafts leave no gaps.
    end note
